      "content": "i don't think anyone can fix this. the more i stay, the more the shame grows. sometimes i look at them and think... if the stain was just gone, they could finally be proud of their legacy again. if i wasn't there to drag them down, everything could go back to how it was supposed to be. wouldn't it be more selfless to just let them move on without the weight of me?",
